        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Liberman, Lew Arrington, Russell James Liberman\n- Products: Brutus\n- Topics: Funny cars, Drag racing\n\nFacts:\n- Brutus is a pioneering funny car from the mid-1960s.\n- Jim Liberman drove Brutus in the mid-1960s.\n- Lew Arrington prepared Brutus as its crew chief in the mid-1960s.\n- Russell James Liberman was born on September 12, 1945.\n- Russell James Liberman was a United States drag racer from Pennsylvania.\n- Russell James Liberman was known as \"Jungle Jim\".\n- Russell James Liberman died on September 9, 1977.",
